  title: "Launch of the MRT System \u2013 1987 "
  info: "The Mass Rapid Transit (MRT) system officially opened in 1987, marking a
    major milestone in Singapore\u2019s transportation history. The first line connected
    Yio Chu Kang to Toa Payoh, providing fast and efficient travel across the island.
    The MRT became a crucial part of Singapore\u2019s public transport network.  "
